{"slug":"Make-Hotsauce-LoffyHUb-242887","_id":"6a54ec6a0a0aee096e615248","title":"LoffyHUb","game":{"_id":"6a434d00499f4aa0cb44c73c","gameId":122391683154858,"name":"🌶️ Make Hotsauce","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-e75278d2981ae28023b515975acb19af-6c8f5177d808.png","placeId":122391683154858},"features":"THE MAIN TRICKS\nSpam-Roll without the Vomit Camera: Turning on Auto Roll forces a background bypass (TweenService metatable injection) that instantly kills the game's annoying script-forced zoom. You can roll indefinitely at 0.3s intervals without your camera twitching or breaking your perspective.\n\nZero-Delay Parallel Buying: Most scripts lag because they check names sequentially. This uses a real-time event listener (ChildAdded) connected directly to the machine. The exact frame a seed spawns, the script checks your toggles and buys it instantly in parallel.\n\nThe 6-Garden Vacuum: Instead of just checking the top folder, Auto Pick Up runs a deep-descendant sweep that digs through all 6 plots simultaneously. It treats the active pepper instances as direct targets so nothing gets stuck in the soil.\n\nTHE BREWING ENGINE\nSmart Heat Sort (High ➔ Low): It doesn't just blindly grab random inventory slots. The algorithm parses the exact text values on your pepper labels, ranks your entire backpack from highest heat to lowest heat, and feeds the hottest fruits into the pot first to maximize your batch quality.\n\nDecoupled Claim Flow: The script splits adding and claiming into two separate modules. You can set a precise batch limit (like 100), let the auto-adder dump them in and halt, and leave the standalone Auto Claim running to handle the boiling cycles exactly how you want.\n\nTHE TRADING DESK\nBulk Shelf Placements: You can override the game's default 1-by-1 bottleneck. Set your multiplier anywhere from 1 to 5, and the loop will grab your hot sauce UUID tags and slap down a full batch onto your open sales slots at a steady, calibrated 0.5-second pace to keep you from getting rate-limited by the server.","tags":["keyless"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/loffy327/LoffyHUB/refs/heads/main/Make-HotSauce.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"695006bef90a62a2da48bfdb","username":"LoffyLORD","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","status":"offline","id":"695006bef90a62a2da48bfdb","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":10}},"verified":false,"views":2137,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/rbx-e75278d2981ae28023b515975acb19af-6c8f5177d808.png","likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":4,"createdAt":"2026-07-13T13:47:22.493Z","executes":1092,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6a54ec6a0a0aee096e61524a","editBy":{"_id":"695006bef90a62a2da48bfdb","username":"LoffyLORD","status":"offline","id":"695006bef90a62a2da48bfdb"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-07-13T13:47:22.496Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"6a54ec83cb5b9cea11b6d36a","commentBy":{"_id":"695006bef90a62a2da48bfdb","username":"LoffyLORD","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","lastActive":"2026-07-28T19:25:22.981Z","createdAt":"2025-12-27T16:18:06.373Z","status":"offline","id":"695006bef90a62a2da48bfdb","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":10}},"text":"more update soon","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-07-13T13:47:47.121Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"6a54ef12054d92b84b720b71","commentBy":{"_id":"6a1f9fadb000dd65d75be316","username":"tonyprmer","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","lastActive":"2026-07-25T18:04:51.907Z","createdAt":"2026-06-03T03:29:49.492Z","status":"offline","id":"6a1f9fadb000dd65d75be316"},"text":"ueyge","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-07-13T13:58:42.322Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"6a54f02557b72669720c8b07","comment